OL,3,ASuspected sabotage causes major
OL,4,ANetherlands rail disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FParts of the Netherlands, including
OL,7,FAmsterdam, have been hit by major rail
OL,8,Fdisruption after suspected sabotage to
OL,9,Fthe tracks, the country's railway
OL,10,Finfrastructure operator has said.
OL,12,FProRail warned that passengers in the
OL,13,Fcountry's centre and north should
OL,14,Fexpect cancellations and delays on
OL,15,FTuesday, while the closure of some
OL,16,Flevel crossings could cause disruption
OL,17,Fto roads.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
